WEBVTT

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:08.500
Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:15.580
ima wa ugokenai sore ga sadame dakedo

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:15.580
Right now I can't move... That is my fate, but...

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:20.720
akirame wa shinai mou mezameta kara

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:20.720
I won't give up anymore because I have awakened.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:25.890
moeru tokimeki wa jidai wo utsushi

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:25.890
My burning, throbbing heart reflects the era...

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:31.060
iro azayaka ni moesakaru honoo

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:31.060
It has the color of vividly blazing flames...

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:35.820
Crying ima wa mienaku tomo

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:35.820
Crying, though I can't see it right now...

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:40.350
Searching michi shirube wa ukabu

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:40.350
Searching, a guidepost floats up ahead.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:43.170
I wanna have a pure time!

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:48.280
Everyone's a noble mind!

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:53.500
soko ni nokotta wakasa toridashi

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:53.500
I'll take out what remains of my youth there,

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.980
Believing a sign of Zeta,

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.540
beyond the hard times from now!

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:06.320
kawaku kuchibiru nureteiru nara

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:06.320
If these dry lips become wet,

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:11.460
toki wo norikoe atsui jidai e to

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:11.460
Beyond time, towards a passionate era,

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:16.500
utsuru darou to shinjiteiru kara

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:16.500
Because I believe it will move...

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:19.060
Believing a sign of Zeta,

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:23.690
beyond the hard times from now...

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:36.100
The Heated Escape

00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:55.120
If you have a moment,
I'd like a word with you, Kamille.

00:02:07.570 --> 00:02:10.600
Won't you come to my room?
The coffee's on.

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:12.610
Not now, Beltorchika.

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:13.640
Hey!

00:02:13.850 --> 00:02:15.470
Beltorchika, sorry.

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:20.310
What's eating you?

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:26.320
You're different from Lt. Quattro.

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:29.060
You're not someone
who loses himself to battles.

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:31.960
I'm surprised to hear that from you...

00:02:32.030 --> 00:02:35.000
...who's beginning to recognize
and accept the realities of battle.

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:40.000
This is not what I expect from you!

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:45.510
You want to return to space, don't you?

00:02:46.110 --> 00:02:49.340
Outer space will increase
Kamille's potential infinitely.

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:54.880
If it's going to influence me
in a positive way as a result...

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:56.980
...then I'd better do it.

00:02:57.060 --> 00:02:58.750
So you're going to use Kamille, are you?!

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:07.260
The five Hizacks are our
only remaining mobile suits.

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:09.160
They're almost ready to send out.

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:10.200
Almost?

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:11.660
How ambiguous.

00:03:11.740 --> 00:03:12.430
Sir.

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:16.170
- What's going on with the Audhumla?
- We've almost caught up with them.

00:03:16.470 --> 00:03:18.270
Be more precise with your responses!

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:19.370
Terribly sorry, sir.

00:03:23.950 --> 00:03:25.580
How are you feeling, Ensign Four?

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:28.240
Am I to sortie?

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:31.550
Calm down, we haven't caught up
with the Audhumla yet.

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:36.490
- Where are you going?
- I'm returning.

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:38.720
I hear you want your memory, Ensign Four.

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:40.250
Captain.

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:43.300
I'm not telling you to shoot
it down. Just hold it back.

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:46.100
At this rate, we'll end up
generously handing the Audhumla...

00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:47.500
...over to the New Guinea Titans.

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:51.040
If our trust in you declines,
in a worst-case scenario...

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:53.080
...we may close
the Newtype Research Laboratory.

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:54.470
Close it?

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:59.480
Should that happen, Ensign,
your memory will be lost forever.

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:00.880
Y-You're lying.

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:01.750
Four.

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:04.180
It all depends on your accomplishments.

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:06.590
I won't let the Titans get in my way!

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:08.850
Well, what a brave thing to say.

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:10.190
The Audhumla is within sight!

00:04:10.260 --> 00:04:11.730
We'll catch them in approximately
15 minutes.

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:12.760
Four?!

00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:21.030
This is a block plan of the Titans
in New Guinea...

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:22.830
...that we received from Luio & Co.

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:24.530
It's still under construction.

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:28.270
If this is the extent of their force,
we'll be able to wipe them out alone.

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:30.650
Want to force our way in
with the Audhumla?

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:32.580
No way!

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:34.310
Director Hayato!

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:36.680
We have a message from New Hong Kong.

00:04:36.990 --> 00:04:38.420
Is it from Luio & Co?

00:04:38.490 --> 00:04:39.420
Yes, sir.

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:40.680
I'll decipher it.

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:44.060
"The Argama will keep its course
in a satellite orbit for 24 hours...

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:46.120
"...from 11:00h today."

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:48.030
The Argama's coming?!

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.330
That's too soon.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:53.370
We won't arrive at New Guinea
until tomorrow morning at the earliest.

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:56.270
Do something! We won't
get too many chances like this.

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:00.310
Enemy craft detected!

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:01.670
It's a mobile suit unit.

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:02.840
- Okay!
- Go get 'em!

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:05.480
Amuro!

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:08.840
Amuro...?

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:11.860
- Can you tell how many?!
- Five units! No, six units!

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:13.620
Hurry up and send out
our own mobile suit unit!

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:15.180
Are the gun platforms ready?!

00:05:20.970 --> 00:05:21.730
Enemies?

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:26.760
<i>That black mobile suit is in the lead.</i>
<i>There are also about five Hizacks.</i>

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:28.330
Roger. I'll need reinforcements.

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:31.640
<i>Amuro, save some strength</i>
<i>to attack New Guinea.</i>

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:33.110
<i>Take it easy.</i>

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:34.770
I know.

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:36.840
Amuro, Rick Dias taking off!

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:45.090
I'll put an end to your chase.

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:58.500
I'll get my memory back
for this war?

00:05:58.570 --> 00:06:00.200
Damn Wooder.

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:06.370
You're in my way!

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:11.770
Are they heading right into the Audhumla?!

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:27.060
Ascend, at top speed! Avoid it!

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:34.400
Hizack unit! I'll leave the
small fry to you.

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:35.800
I just need to take out the source.

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:47.410
- It missed!
- I missed?!

00:06:47.850 --> 00:06:49.220
No one who gets in my way...!

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:55.150
Great move, Amuro!

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:57.660
Beltorchika, where's Kamille?

00:06:58.100 --> 00:06:59.790
I'm not his babysitter!

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:00.830
Beltorchika?!

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:03.760
I apologize, Director Hayato.

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:10.740
Mk. II, taking off!

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:19.780
This'll finish you!

00:07:23.650 --> 00:07:25.180
It's no use!

00:07:27.890 --> 00:07:30.120
I told you I would allow no one
to get in my way.

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:35.460
What's this sensation?!

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:38.130
My head feels like it's going to split!

00:07:40.470 --> 00:07:42.270
What happened all of a sudden?!

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:00.650
What about the Audhumla?!

00:08:05.730 --> 00:08:06.820
You're not getting away!

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:12.530
Where'd it go?!

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:18.500
- Mr. Amuro.
- Your guard's down, Kamille!

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:19.570
I'm sorry.

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:28.850
We're entering the satellite orbit.

00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:40.250
Why did you leave the battle line?!

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:42.220
You must fight!

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:44.630
It's for your good as well.

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:47.570
I'm telling you that I'm tired.

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:48.870
What are you saying?

00:08:49.570 --> 00:08:51.340
What good is all your effort
if you don't fight?!

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:52.670
My head... It hurts.

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:53.710
Four.

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:56.670
What did you do that for?!

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:58.040
Don't you want your memory, Four?!

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:09.220
If I submit a report, your memory
will be restored in no time.

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:12.760
This opportunity is within your grasp.

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:14.400
Fight, Four.

00:09:14.970 --> 00:09:16.990
You are a flawless Newtype.

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:20.060
You cannot be defeated.
All you need to do is prove that point.

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:23.100
All right, Namicar.

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:33.950
Ensign Four Murasame, taking off!

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:41.780
There she goes.

00:09:41.860 --> 00:09:43.190
Put me on the ship's P.A. system.

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:44.230
Yes, sir!

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:46.530
Go ahead.

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:49.430
<i>This is Captain Wooder speaking.</i>

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:52.400
<i>All units, stop what you're doing</i>
<i>and listen carefully to this announcement.</i>

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:55.570
<i>Now that we've lost our mobile suit unit...</i>

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:59.600
<i>...our ship's fighting ability, aside from</i>
<i>the Psyco Gundam, is practically zero.</i>

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:03.270
<i>Yet, we no longer have the time</i>
<i>to replenish.</i>

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:07.110
<i>Our last resort is a suicide attack</i>
<i>with this ship.</i>

00:10:07.890 --> 00:10:10.620
<i>All crewmembers are to</i>
<i>abandon ship at once.</i>

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:13.720
<i>The suicide attack will begin when</i>
<i>we catch up with the Audhumla.</i>

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:14.760
<i>That is all.</i>

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:17.190
- Get the Base Jabber ready!
- C'mon, hurry!

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:19.490
We'll get everyone on it!

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:22.720
Hey, what do you think?
Unless we leave, we'll also...!

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:24.230
You guys hurry on, too.

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:25.430
We'll be excused, sir!

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:31.170
You'd better hurry as well.

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:37.410
Now, let's just see how much
the Psyco Gundam can do for us.

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:43.080
Captain Wooder.

00:10:43.150 --> 00:10:45.150
Please allow us to remain here with you.

00:10:45.860 --> 00:10:47.050
Officers...!

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:51.920
Okay!

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:55.060
Take your positions at the gun platforms!
Don't let enemy mobile suits get close!

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:56.770
Roger!

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:07.170
Any word from the Argama yet?

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:10.050
We're expecting something any time now,
but there's too much static.

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:12.980
Even if the Argama arrives,
we have no shuttle.

00:11:13.050 --> 00:11:14.480
Amuro.

00:11:14.550 --> 00:11:15.990
How could we miss this chance?

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:18.720
Kamille!

00:11:19.090 --> 00:11:20.060
Kamille!

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:24.360
- I have a favor to ask you!
- Me?

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:28.290
You like Amuro, don't you?

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:30.390
Stop beating around the bush.
What is it that you want?

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:34.200
I don't want to leave Amuro by your side.

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:37.200
As long as he's by your side,
Amuro will continue to overdo things.

00:11:37.270 --> 00:11:39.830
Amuro will soon end up dead.

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:43.240
So you feel that I'm
not strong enough?

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:44.510
No, I don't!

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:46.850
Yes, you do! You just said so!

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:50.250
I'm saying that when he's with you,
Kamille, Amuro tries too hard!

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:52.720
Then I really can't do anything
about that.

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:56.020
You've got no choice but to tell
Mr. Amuro to be more cautious!

00:11:56.090 --> 00:11:58.030
He wouldn't listen!

00:11:58.100 --> 00:11:59.960
Maybe not. He's too serious.

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:14.570
Maybe not. He's too serious.

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:17.870
That's why I'm asking you to
think about what to do.

00:12:17.950 --> 00:12:20.540
There's obviously nothing that I can do!

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:22.880
<i>Enemy attack!</i>
<i>Ready to send out mobile suits!</i>

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:23.890
Bye!

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:25.950
Promise me that you'll return
Amuro safely!

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:28.390
That's the selfishness of a woman!

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:32.090
Please realize that such
selfishness could get a man killed!

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:33.130
Kamille!

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:38.160
"A woman's selfishness
could get a man killed?"

00:12:38.240 --> 00:12:39.170
Kamille?

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:46.040
- Kamille, you're quick!
- Please let me go first!

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:57.480
Has Kamille come out?

00:12:58.190 --> 00:13:01.060
His timing is as if he'd been waiting
for me all along!

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:04.800
Four!

00:13:07.770 --> 00:13:09.860
You can run all you like, but I'll find you!

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:14.140
Kamille, why won't you fire?!

00:13:18.910 --> 00:13:20.930
- Kamille, stay back!
- I'll do it!

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:23.540
I know that enemy well!

00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:28.280
Kamille, are you sure?

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:32.520
The Sudori's heading
straight for something.

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:34.110
What's it up to?!

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:41.190
She's quick!

00:13:50.980 --> 00:13:52.240
Four!

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:54.400
The Sudori's coming straight at us!

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:55.410
What?!

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:57.450
From such a short distance!

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:07.090
Four, are you listening to me?

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:10.250
Since you'd launched, why
didn't you get rid of me right away?!

00:14:10.730 --> 00:14:12.720
I'm on my way there! Open your hatch!

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:13.850
<i>Stop it!</i>

00:14:14.770 --> 00:14:15.700
Four!

00:14:27.310 --> 00:14:28.280
Four.

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:31.410
You're reckless!

00:14:31.820 --> 00:14:32.780
Four.

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:34.640
There's something I haven't told you yet.

00:14:35.090 --> 00:14:37.050
Yes? What is it?

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:39.420
About my parents.

00:14:39.490 --> 00:14:41.690
They were killed when they got mixed up
in the battle...

00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:43.730
...between the A.E.U.G. and Titans.

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:46.160
In front of my eyes.

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:53.440
I used to live in Green One of Side Seven.

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:55.600
I went to the high school there.

00:14:56.570 --> 00:14:58.540
My dad was a designer of mobile suits.

00:14:59.010 --> 00:15:00.980
He also designed this Mk. II.

00:15:01.850 --> 00:15:04.280
My mom was a specialist
in material engineering...

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:06.910
...had cooperated
on the development of the Mk. II.

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:09.550
My dad had a lover.

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:12.180
My mom knew that,
but said nothing about it.

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:13.950
You want to know why?

00:15:14.020 --> 00:15:15.180
Why?

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:17.450
She enjoyed her work so much.

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:22.230
A girl I've known since I was little
tells me in place of my mother...

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:24.600
..."Stop biting your nails, Kamille!"

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:27.600
It's always, "Stop it, Kamille!"

00:15:28.270 --> 00:15:29.760
I've never liked it.

00:15:30.640 --> 00:15:33.540
Because Kamille's a girl's name, right?

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:36.010
I hated it. All along.

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:37.870
And?

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:38.570
Right.

00:15:38.650 --> 00:15:40.910
So I began taking karate lessons.

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:43.950
I also flew a Homo Avis,
and even made mobile suits.

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:47.150
I needed to prove that
I was a man.

00:15:47.560 --> 00:15:48.750
Kamille.

00:15:50.430 --> 00:15:53.330
I... I... What am I talking about?

00:15:53.860 --> 00:15:55.090
Four.

00:15:55.170 --> 00:15:58.500
Why am I telling you all this?

00:15:58.570 --> 00:15:59.830
Kamille.

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:02.800
Kamille, can I ask you one more time?

00:16:04.010 --> 00:16:06.670
Do you still dislike your name, Kamille?

00:16:06.740 --> 00:16:08.340
No, I like it.

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:10.140
It's my own name, after all.

00:16:10.680 --> 00:16:11.480
I see.

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:18.620
L-Let's both return to the respective places
where we belong.

00:16:18.690 --> 00:16:20.680
This place is not suited to you.

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:23.430
Are you serious, Four?

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:25.790
Four!

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:27.660
Get out of here! Forget it!

00:16:27.730 --> 00:16:29.100
Four, but...!

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:31.570
The next time you get close to me...!

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:34.040
The next time you get close to me,
I'll really shoot!

00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:35.070
Understand?!

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:42.740
K-Kamille. Does this mean
I won't have to ever forget again?

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:51.820
We're not done yet!

00:16:54.190 --> 00:16:55.620
Where's that black one going?!

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:04.160
What?!

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:05.790
The Psyco Gundam!

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:12.940
What's going on with that
black mobile suit?!

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:15.340
I don't know.
I don't know, but...!

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:17.080
Four...!

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:22.210
Captain, Four is moving
the shuttle booster!

00:17:22.690 --> 00:17:23.980
Take over the controls!

00:17:24.050 --> 00:17:25.720
- Direct the ship to the top of the Audhumla!
- Yes, sir!

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:29.130
Is she planning to make the Sudori lighter
by throwing out the booster?

00:17:33.060 --> 00:17:34.030
Ensign!

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:36.130
What are you doing?!

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:37.930
Don't try to stop me!

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:39.640
Hey!

00:17:48.850 --> 00:17:50.510
I demand an explanation!

00:17:50.950 --> 00:17:54.150
I told you at the very beginning,
that I'll do as I wish!

00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:54.950
You little bitch!

00:17:55.990 --> 00:17:56.950
Kamille!

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:02.190
What was that?!

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:03.890
Kamille, did you hear that?!

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:05.260
Mr. Amuro.

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:08.990
"Return to space with the Sudori's booster,"
that's what she's saying.

00:18:09.070 --> 00:18:10.330
Four is?

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:16.770
Damn!

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:18.330
Kamille!

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:21.570
Use the Sudori's booster to escape to space!
I'll cover you!

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:22.980
But...!

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:25.480
If that voice belongs to the enemy
you were talking about...

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:28.990
...then she is risking her life
to help you escape!

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:30.710
She is?!

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:31.690
<i>Can he tell?!</i>

00:18:32.260 --> 00:18:33.920
Those who ignore another's good intentions...

00:18:33.990 --> 00:18:36.460
...will regret it for the rest
of their lives, Kamille!

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:39.260
Mr. Amuro.

00:18:39.530 --> 00:18:41.960
I understand. I'm going!

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:44.600
Hayato!

00:18:44.670 --> 00:18:46.030
We should be able
to reach the Argama now!

00:18:53.810 --> 00:18:55.780
The Mk. II is connecting to the booster?!

00:18:55.850 --> 00:18:57.840
Can he ascend to space
with a shuttle booster?!

00:18:57.920 --> 00:19:00.320
If he can't, we'll just go fetch him!

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:07.360
Four, what's wrong?!

00:19:07.420 --> 00:19:09.050
Are you hurt?!

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:12.230
Kamille!

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:13.720
Four!

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:16.520
What do they plan to do with the booster?

00:19:17.230 --> 00:19:19.000
Captain! If we hit the booster...

00:19:19.070 --> 00:19:20.430
- ...the Sudori will...!
- I know that!

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:24.240
Are they serious?!
The Sudori will go down, too!

00:19:28.510 --> 00:19:30.480
The course the Argama's on
matches perfectly!

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:32.210
Send the Argama a message!

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:34.180
"We don't know exactly when
the Mk. II will shoot out!"

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:35.680
"Make sure to pick it up!"

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:36.580
Roger.

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:38.310
You're in my way!

00:19:40.890 --> 00:19:41.760
Mr. Amuro!

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:43.090
I'm not letting them stop you!

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:43.920
Go, Kamille!

00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:51.070
Kamille! You can go now, right?!

00:19:51.130 --> 00:19:53.100
The Argama will surely pick you up!
Trust them!

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:56.370
I can alter my course with this...

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:57.600
...but will the Argama be there?!

00:20:03.310 --> 00:20:04.800
Kamille...

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:06.540
...go out into space.

00:20:08.590 --> 00:20:09.450
Goodbye...!

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:12.110
Will this thing really take me there?

00:20:22.100 --> 00:20:23.660
Can he get into orbit with that?!

00:20:23.730 --> 00:20:25.100
Once he gets up there,
Bright will retrieve him!

00:20:26.670 --> 00:20:28.370
<i>Kamille, go!</i>

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:29.600
<i>The Argama's waiting for you!</i>

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:31.040
Roger, I'm going!

00:20:50.590 --> 00:20:54.290
Four! Did I do the right thing?! Four!

00:20:58.440 --> 00:21:00.370
Don't rely on machinery! Use your eyes!

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:03.130
We'll use the ballute, descend as low
as we can, and pick up the Gundam there!

00:21:11.380 --> 00:21:14.440
We've detected light on the visual display!
Right rear!

00:21:14.520 --> 00:21:16.450
Okay, shift a bit to the right!

00:21:18.490 --> 00:21:19.680
Decrease altitude a little more!

00:21:19.760 --> 00:21:20.780
How's the friction heat?!

00:21:21.120 --> 00:21:23.180
We're still okay!
We've reached our limit!

00:21:23.930 --> 00:21:24.860
Open the ballute!

00:21:32.900 --> 00:21:34.670
I see it!
Mk. II, we're leaving the booster!

00:21:54.190 --> 00:21:56.630
Kamille, don't lose your way.

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:10.870
Welcome back, Kamille.

00:22:10.940 --> 00:22:13.340
Thank you very much, Captain Bright.

00:22:20.550 --> 00:22:21.380
Where's Fa?

00:22:21.450 --> 00:22:24.580
She's gone to Granada.
Lt. Quattro and Katz are there, too.

00:22:25.990 --> 00:22:27.290
Is that right?

00:22:27.360 --> 00:22:28.650
To Granada.

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:49.600
Oh, I can't help believing you

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
kanarazu aeru to ano hi kara shinjiteita

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
I've believed we're sure to meet again ever since that day

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
kitto yobiau kokoro ga areba

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
If we have heart, we'll be called together again

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
mugen no Energy yobisamasu

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
Awaken the infinite energy

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
aa kizutsukeau mae ni

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
Before you get hurt

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
dekiru koto sagashite Please

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
Find what you can do...Please

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
nagedasanai de kurushii toki koso

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
Don't throw it away because of this painful age

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
itsuka mita aoi sora wo

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
Until the day we gaze up again

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
kitto anata to miageru hi made

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
at the blue sky we once saw

00:23:45.410 --> 00:23:48.510
Upon returning to the Argama,
Kamille cannot help but feel lonely.

00:23:49.380 --> 00:23:53.680
In space, Kamille is challenged by
the Titans' new model mobile suits.

00:23:54.750 --> 00:23:58.590
During the ensuing battle, Kamille
receives additional support...

00:23:59.260 --> 00:24:02.520
...in the form of Fa Yuiry's heart.

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:07.600
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam,
"A Sign of Zeta".

00:24:07.470 --> 00:24:12.470
Next Episode

00:24:07.470 --> 00:24:12.470
A Sign of Zeta

00:24:08.700 --> 00:24:12.600
You will see the tears of time.
